+### USB at high speed only
+
+If the SuperSpeed lanes of the USB port go through a redriver or a Type-C
+orientation switch that lk2nd does not set up, the USB 3 controller keeps
+retrying SuperSpeed and never connects at high speed, so the host does not
+see the device at all. `lk2nd,usb-high-speed-only` skips the SuperSpeed PHY
+and runs the controller at high speed only.
+
+```
+	lk2nd,usb-high-speed-only;
+```
+
