+	/*
+	 * Some devices route the SuperSpeed lanes through a redriver or a
+	 * Type-C orientation switch that lk2nd does not set up. The
+	 * controller then retries SuperSpeed forever instead of falling back
+	 * to high speed, and the host never sees it. Take the same path as
